# Arithmetic Lefschetz–Stepanov theory

Stepanov's half of Weil's proof over `Spec ℤ`: which Frobenius, which auxiliaries, which orders of
vanishing and which identity plays the role of `x^q = x`. The exact Frobenius of the prime torus is
the Galois action on its torsion, with the norm as integrality amplifier. See
`ArithmeticLefschetzStepanovTheory/README.md`.
-/
